guideos-browser-mail-backup (1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added support for Geary
  * Added optional AES-256 encryption via GnuPG
  * Added password generator (20 characters, secure)
  * Added password strength analysis with color feedback
  * Added Snap and Flatpak profile detection for all supported apps
  * Added automatic profile detection with status display

